<title>SPAIN: Dragados H1 profit falls 3 percent.</title>
<headline>Dragados H1 profit falls 3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June results for building group Dragados, in billions of pesetas unless stated.</p>
<p> Profit			  3.991    down 3 percent</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name Dragados y Construcciones SA. The group said turnover was over 192.0 billion pesetas in the first half, up 3 percent.</p>
<p>Profit figures were affected by weak public sector demand, the firm said.</p>
<p>International orders have allowed the group to increase its order book to 620.0 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>Dragados gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
